        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Back to Back Decorative 10\" Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBack to back pair of traditional style decorative door pulls. Cast in solid brass and finished in your choice of 5 different finish colors. Manufactured by Deltana, these 10\" decorative door pulls are 1\" in diameter with a 3\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2578-Specifications.gif?v=1704354657\" width\"583\" height=\"213\" border=\"0\" atl=\"10 Inch Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana PR-DP2578 Traditional 10 Inch Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Screws: 1/4\"-24 x 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/10-inch-decorative-door-pull-with-rosettes-deltana-dp2578\"><b>10\" Decorative Door Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</i>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "10 Inch Decorative Door Pulls, Pair, Deltana PR-DP2578",
